    {
      "id": "blk-0350",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "答题技巧：先抄材料关键词，再结合自己的生活经验写感想。千万不要留空白。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0351",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题1",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0352",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0353",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你搬了新家，发现前房主留下了一个旧木柜。柜子有些旧但结构完好。你没有扔掉它，而是刷了一层新漆，换了几个把手，放在客厅当电视柜用。朋友来家里都说“这个柜子很有味道”。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0354",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请分析这个旧木柜的处理方式体现了可持续设计的哪些理念？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0355",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0356",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 体现了重复使用设计，旧物继续发挥使用价值。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0357",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 体现了升级再造，通过改造让旧物焕发新生。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0358",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 体现了耐久性设计，结构完好的家具不应该被丢弃。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0359",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 体现了情感化设计，旧物承载记忆，改造后产生新的情感联结。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0360",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 延长了产品的使用寿命，减少了木材消耗和垃圾产生。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0361",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你来处理这个旧木柜，你还会有什么其他的改造思路？请说出至少两种。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0362",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0363",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 改成书架，加几块隔板就是书架。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0364",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 改成玄关柜，放在进门处放鞋和钥匙。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0365",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 改成花架，放在阳台种花。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0366",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 改成儿童玩具收纳柜，刷成彩色。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0367",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 拆开重新组合成小凳子或小桌子。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0368",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题2",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0369",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0370",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你买了一款“可以替换刷头”的牙刷。牙刷柄是竹子做的，刷毛磨损后只需要买新的刷头换上，不用换整支牙刷。一支牙刷柄可以用好几年，刷头每三个月换一次。包装是一个简单的纸盒，没有塑料。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0371",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：这款牙刷的设计体现了哪些可持续设计策略？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0372",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0373",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 模块化设计，刷头和刷柄分离，易损件单独更换。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0374",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 减量化设计，只换刷头不换整支，减少材料消耗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0375",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 材料选择，竹柄可再生，纸盒包装可回收。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0376",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 耐久性设计，刷柄结实耐用，可以用好几年。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0377",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 延长产品使用寿命，减少塑料垃圾。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0378",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：你觉得这款牙刷还有什么可以改进的地方？请提出至少两条建议。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0379",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0380",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 刷头可以设计成不同硬度，满足不同用户需求。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0381",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 刷柄可以设计成可调节角度，方便不同握持习惯。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0382",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 可以推出“订阅制”，定期寄送新刷头，提醒用户更换。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0383",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 包装可以进一步简化，只用一张纸。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0384",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 刷头材料可以用回收塑料，形成闭环。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0385",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题3",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0386",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0387",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你发现小区门口新开了一家“零包装”超市。店里所有商品都没有一次性包装，顾客需要自己带容器来装。米面粮油按斤称，洗发水沐浴露按毫升打，零食干果装进自己带的袋子里。价格比普通超市便宜一点，因为省了包装费。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0388",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：这家超市的模式体现了什么可持续设计理念？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0389",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0390",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 从源头减少包装废弃物，减量化设计的极致体现。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0391",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 鼓励消费者重复使用容器，养成环保习惯。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0392",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 用服务替代产品包装，是产品服务系统的思路。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0393",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 降低包装成本，让利消费者，商业可持续。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0394",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 培养社区环保文化，形成可持续的生活方式。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0395",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你去这家超市购物，你会怎么准备？你觉得这种模式有什么不方便的地方？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
