    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0453",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题7",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0454",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0455",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你家的旧羽绒服不穿了，你本来想扔掉，后来发现有个“旧衣回收”平台可以上门取件。旧羽绒服被拆解后，羽绒被提取出来做成新羽绒服的填充物，面料被做成环保袋。平台还给你发了5块钱环保红包。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0456",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：这个旧衣回收平台体现了什么可持续设计模式？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0457",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0458",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 循环再生设计，旧衣物被拆解后材料重新利用。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0459",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 升级再造，旧羽绒服变成新羽绒服和环保袋。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0460",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 产品服务系统，用回收服务替代简单的丢弃。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0461",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 用经济激励鼓励消费者参与回收。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0462",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 形成“生产\\-消费\\-回收\\-再生”的闭环系统。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0463",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你来设计一个旧物回收平台，你会怎么让更多人愿意参与？请提出至少三条建议。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0464",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0465",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 简化流程，一键预约上门取件，不用自己搬。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0466",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 给实质性奖励，比如现金红包、优惠券、环保积分。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0467",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 公布回收去向，让用户知道自己的旧物变成了什么。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0468",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 和社区合作，设置固定回收点，方便老年人。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0469",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 做排行榜，看谁回收得多，增加趣味性。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0470",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题8",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0471",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0472",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你参观了一个“可持续生活实验室”。这个实验室是一个老厂房改造的，屋顶装了太阳能板，墙上种了绿植，雨水被收集起来浇花和冲厕所。里面展示了很多可持续设计产品：竹制家具、回收塑料做的文具、可降解的餐具。参观者可以亲手体验这些产品，还可以参加旧物改造工作坊。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0473",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：这个“可持续生活实验室”体现了哪些可持续设计策略？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0474",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0475",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 建筑改造再利用，老厂房焕发新生。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0476",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 可再生能源利用，太阳能板供电。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0477",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 自然降温，绿植墙减少空调能耗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0478",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 水资源循环，雨水收集利用。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0479",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 可持续产品展示和教育，培养公众意识。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0480",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你要设计一个“可持续生活”的社区活动，你会怎么策划？请说出至少三条具体内容。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0481",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0482",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 举办旧物改造工作坊，教大家把旧衣服改成购物袋。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0483",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 组织“零包装”市集，大家带容器来买东西。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0484",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 做“碳足迹”挑战赛，看谁一周碳排放最少。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0485",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 邀请专家讲可持续设计，提高居民认知。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0486",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 建社区共享工具库，电钻、梯子等不常用的工具共享。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
